{% render 'logo-animation-overlay' %}


<div class="fulu-content-container">
    <div class="fulu-page-about-container">
        <div class="fulu-about-spacer"></div>
        <div class="fulu-about-content">
            <div class="fulu-about-container">
                <div class="fulu-about">
                    <div class="fulu-about-image">
                        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1043/1584/6995/files/banner3.png?v=1778528129" alt="About Us" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" width="1200" height="800"/>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="fulu-about-title">About Us</h1>
                    <div class="fulu-about-text">
                        <p>SZENECLUB is a Berlin-based digital concept store dedicated to showcasing emerging designers from around the world. The platform brings together unseen creativity in one carefully curated space, offering a destination to discover fresh perspectives, new talent, and distinctive design beyond the mainstream fashion landscape.</p>
                        <p>More than just a retail platform, SZENECLUB creates visibility for independent creatives by highlighting the stories behind their work. Every designer is introduced through in-depth interviews and dedicated social features, giving audiences insight into their creative process, vision, and personal journey while allowing designers to sell their pieces on their own terms.</p>
                        <p>The platform focuses on clothing, jewellery, accessories, and objects that are often produced in small quantities or made to order, with items shipped directly from the designers themselves. By collaborating closely with emerging brands, SZENECLUB supports slower, more intentional approaches to design and production, challenging traditional retail models shaped by mass production and seasonal cycles.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fulu-about-apply">
                        <a href="/pages/apply" class="fulu-about-apply-btn">Join us now!</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            {% section 'footer' %}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script></script>

<style>
    .fulu-content-container {
        height: 100%;
        width: 100%;
        z-index: 3;
        pointer-events: all !important;
        background-color: white;
    }
    .fulu-page-about-container {
        display: grid;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 6.2fr;
        z-index: 200;
    }
    .fulu-about-spacer {
        height: 100%;
    }
    .fulu-about-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 35px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        width: calc(100% - 13.8%);
        font-family: "Inter";
    }

    .fulu-about {
        width: 65%;
        position: relative;
        right: 2%;
        z-index: 2;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 100px;
    }

    .fulu-about-title {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        text-align: start;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .fulu-about-text p {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #333;
        font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .fulu-about-image {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 16/9;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 15px;
    }

    .fulu-about-image img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        background-color: #e0e0e0;
        object-position: top;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    .fulu-about-apply-btn {
        background: transparent;
        border: 0;
        display: inline-block;
        position: relative;
        font-family: "Inter";
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: #333;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .fulu-about-apply-btn::after,
    .fulu-about-apply-btn::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        bottom: -4px;
        width: 100%;
        height: 3px;
        background-color: black; 
        transform: scaleX(0);
        transform-origin: left;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .fulu-about-apply-btn:hover::after,
    .fulu-about-apply-btn:hover::after {
        transform: scaleX(1);
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

        .fulu-about {
            width: 100%;
            right: 0;
            margin-top: 25svh;
        }
        .fulu-about-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
    }
</style>